# Repo-root .gitignore has a case-insensitive `Public/` rule (for another
# project) that also matches this project's public/ dir on case-insensitive
# filesystems (macOS). Un-ignore it here so static assets (favicon, models,
# audio, etc.) actually get committed.
!public/
!public/**

# !public/** 會把上面的忽略反轉掉，.DS_Store 得再擋一次
.DS_Store
